Attribution

This library implements the public API of HereBeDragons-1.0 by Hendrik Leppkes
(Nevcairiel), which declares "BSD" as its licence. The implementation here is
independent: HereBeDragons queries the running client and works from world
coordinates, while this library works from a static zone table generated offline
from the vanilla WorldMapArea DBC and from 0-1 map coordinates, because the
client it targets exposes no world position at all. No HereBeDragons code is
included.

BSD 2-Clause is used so that this library and its companion,
LibHereBeDragons-Pins-1.0 -- which does contain ported HereBeDragons code, and
carries Nevcairiel's copyright accordingly -- are distributed under the same
terms as the work they follow.
